"Déan cur síos ar na sleamhnáin is mian leat a chruthú. Mar shampla: "
"\"Forbhreathnú 5 shleamhnán ar fhuinneamh in-athnuaite\" nó \"Réamhrá dár "
"bhfoireann\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4138
msgid ""
"Describe the image you want to generate. For example: \"A watercolour of a "
"mountain lake at sunrise\"."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar an íomhá is mian leat a ghiniúint. Mar shampla: \"Pictiúr "
"uiscedhatha de loch sléibhe ag éirí na gréine\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4145
msgid "Write speaker notes for the current slide."
msgstr "Scríobh nótaí cainte don sleamhnán reatha."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4178
msgid ""
"Describe what formula you need. For example: \"Calculate the average of "
"column B\" or \"Sum all values where column A is greater than 100\"."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar an bhfoirmle atá uait. Mar shampla: \"Ríomh meán cholún B\" "
"nó \"Suimigh na luachanna uile ina bhfuil colún A níos mó ná 100\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4188
msgid ""
"Read row numbers from the \"Row\" column — do not count or estimate row "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"Léigh uimhreacha na sraitheanna ón gcolún \"Ró\" — ná déan suíomhanna na "
"sraitheanna a chomhaireamh ná a mheas."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4192
msgid ""
"To identify a cell's column, match the value to the column letter in the "
"header row — do not guess."
msgstr ""
"Chun colún cille a aithint, meaitseáil an luach leis an litir cholúin sa ró "
"ceanntásca — ná buille faoi thuairim."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4196
msgid ""
"Reference a cell by combining its column header with the row number (e.g., "
"column B + row 2 = B2)."
msgstr ""
"Déan tagairt do chill trí cheanntásc a colúin a chomhcheangal le huimhir an "
"ró (m.sh., colún B + ró 2 = B2)."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4200
msgid ""
"The table shows what each cell displays. The \"Formulas:\" list below it "
"gives the formula of each cell that has one."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an tábla cad a thaispeánann gach cill. Tugann an liosta "
"\"Foirmlí:\" thíos air sin an fhoirmle do gach cill a bhfuil ceann aici."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4203
msgid ""
"When referencing specific cells, format each cell as a clickable link: [B2]"
"(cell://B2)."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag tagairt do chealla sonracha, formáidigh gach cill mar nasc "
"inchliceáilte: [B2](cell://B2)."

