msgstr "Féach cé eile atá ag cur in eagar agus roinn an doiciméad."

#: src/control/onboarding/OnboardingSteps.ts:110
msgid "The status bar"
msgstr "An barra stádais"

#: src/control/onboarding/OnboardingSteps.ts:112
msgid ""
