#: src/errormessages.ts:16
msgid "No disk space left."
msgstr "Níl aon spás diosca fágtha."

#: src/errormessages.ts:17
msgid "No disk space left on server."
msgstr "Níl spás diosca fágtha ar an bhfreastalaí."

#: src/errormessages.ts:19
msgid ""
"The host URL is empty. The coolwsd server is probably misconfigured, please "
"contact the administrator."
msgstr ""
"Tá URL an óstaigh folamh. Is dócha go bhfuil an freastalaí coolwsd "
"míchumraithe, déan teagmháil leis an riarthóir le do thoil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:22
msgid ""
"This is an unsupported version of {productname}. To avoid the impression "
"that it is suitable for deployment in enterprises, this message appears "
"when more than {docs} documents or {connections} connections are in use "
"concurrently."
msgstr ""
"Seo leagan nach dtacaítear leis de {productname}. Chun an tuiscint go bhfuil "
"sé oiriúnach le himscaradh i bhfiontair a sheachaint, feictear an "
"teachtaireacht seo nuair a bhíonn níos mó ná doiciméid {docs} nó naisc "
"{connections} in úsáid i gcomhthráth."

#: src/errormessages.ts:24
msgid "More information and support"
msgstr "Tuilleadh eolais agus tacaíochta"

#: src/errormessages.ts:26
msgid ""
"This service is limited to {0} documents, and {1} connections total by the "
"admin. This limit has been reached. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Tá an tseirbhís seo teoranta do {0} doiciméad, agus {1} nasc san iomlán ag "
"an riarthóir. Tá an teorainn seo sroichte. Bain triail eile as ar ball."

#: src/errormessages.ts:29
msgid ""
"Service is unavailable. Please try again later and report to your "
"administrator if the issue persists."
msgstr ""
"Níl an tseirbhís ar fáil. Bain triail eile as ar ball agus cuir in iúl le do "
"riarthóir má leanann an fhadhb."

#: src/errormessages.ts:32
msgid ""
"Unauthorized WOPI host. Please try again later and report to your "
"administrator if the issue persists."
msgstr ""
"Óstach WOPI neamhúdaraithe. Bain triail eile as ar ball agus cuir in iúl le "
"do riarthóir má leanann an fhadhb."

#: src/errormessages.ts:35
msgid ""
"You no longer have access to this document. Its security label was changed."
msgstr ""
"Níl rochtain agat a thuilleadh ar an doiciméad seo. Athraíodh a lipéad "
"slándála."

#: src/errormessages.ts:38
msgid ""
"You can no longer edit this document. Its security label was changed. "
"Please open it again to view it."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leat an doiciméad seo a chur in eagar a thuilleadh. Athraíodh a "
"lipéad slándála. Oscail arís é le do thoil chun é a fheiceáil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:40
msgid "Authorization error was: '{errormessage}'."
msgstr "Earráid údaraithe: '{errormessage}'."

#: src/errormessages.ts:42
msgid "Wrong or missing WOPISrc parameter, please contact support."
msgstr ""
"Paraiméadar WOPISrc mícheart nó in easnamh, déan teagmháil leis an "
"bhfoireann tacaíochta."

#: src/errormessages.ts:45
msgid "Your session will end in {time}. Refresh the page to continue."
msgstr ""
"Críochnóidh do sheisiún i gceann {time}. Athnuaigh an leathanach le leanúint "
"ar aghaidh."

#: src/errormessages.ts:48
msgid ""
"Your session has ended. Further changes to the document might not be saved. "
"Refresh the page to continue."
msgstr ""
"Tá deireadh le do sheisiún. B’fhéidir nach sábhálfar aon athruithe eile ar "
"an doiciméad. Athnuaigh an leathanach le leanúint ar aghaidh."

#: src/errormessages.ts:51
msgid ""
"Failed to load the document. Please ensure the file type is supported and "
"not corrupted, and try again."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar lódáil an doiciméid. Cinntigh le do thoil go dtacaítear leis an "
"gcineál comhaid agus nach bhfuil sé truaillithe, agus bain triail eile as."

#: src/errormessages.ts:53
msgid "Invalid link: '{url}'"
msgstr "Nasc neamhbhailí: '{url}'"

#: src/errormessages.ts:55
msgid ""
"You are leaving the document. The following web page will open in a new "
"tab: "
msgstr ""
"Tá tú ag fágáil an doiciméid. Osclófar an leathanach gréasáin seo a leanas i "
"gcluaisín nua: "

#: src/errormessages.ts:58
msgid ""
"Failed to load the document. This document is either malformed or is taking "
"more resources than allowed. Please contact the administrator."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar lódáil an doiciméid. Tá an doiciméad seo míchumtha nó tá níos mó "
"acmhainní á n-úsáid aige ná mar a cheadaítear. Déan teagmháil leis an "
"riarthóir le do thoil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:60
msgid "Cleaning up the document from the last session."
msgstr "An doiciméad a ghlanadh ón seisiún deiridh."

#: src/errormessages.ts:62
msgid ""
"We are in the process of cleaning up this document from the last session, "
"please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Táimid i mbun an doiciméad seo a ghlanadh ón seisiún deiridh, bain triail "
"eile as ar ball le do thoil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:65
msgid ""
"Your {productname} cluster appear to be mis-configured or scaling rapidly - "
"please contact your system administrator. Continuing with editing may "
"result in multiple users not seeing each other, conflicts in the document "
"storage and/or copy/paste problems. Expected serverId {0} for routeToken "
"{1} but connected to serverId {2}"
msgstr ""
"Is cosúil go bhfuil do bhraisle {productname} míchumraithe nó go bhfuil sé "
"ag scála go tapa - déan teagmháil le riarthóir do chórais. Má leantar leis "
"an eagarthóireacht d’fhéadfadh sé tarlú nach bhfeiceann úsáideoirí iolracha "
"a chéile, go mbeadh coinbhleachtaí ann maidir le stóráil doiciméad agus/nó "
"fadhbanna cóipe/greamaigh. Bhíothas ag súil le serverId {0} le haghaidh "
"routeToken {1} ach nasctha le serverId {2}"

#: src/errormessages.ts:68
msgid ""
"Failed to establish socket connection or socket connection closed "
"unexpectedly. The reverse proxy might be misconfigured, please contact the "
"administrator. For more info on proxy configuration please checkout https://"
"sdk.collaboraonline.com/docs/installation/Proxy_settings.html"
msgstr ""
"Theip ar bhunú nasc soicéad nó nasc soicéad dúnta gan choinne. Seans go "
"bhfuil an seachfhreastalaí cúil míchumraithe, déan teagmháil leis an "
"riarthóir le do thoil. Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais ar chumraíocht "
"seachfhreastalaí seiceáil amach le do thoil https://sdk.collaboraonline.com/"
"docs/installation/Proxy_settings.html"

#: src/errormessages.ts:71
msgid ""
"Failed to establish socket connection or socket connection closed "
"unexpectedly."
msgstr "Theip ar bhunú nasc soicéad nó nasc soicéad dúnta gan choinne."

#: src/errormessages.ts:74
msgid "Uploading file to server failed, file not found."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar uaslódáil an chomhaid chuig an bhfreastalaí, níor aimsíodh an "
"comhad."

#: src/errormessages.ts:75
msgid "Uploading file to server failed, the file is too large."
msgstr "Theip ar uaslódáil comhad chuig an bhfreastalaí, tá an comhad ró-mhór."

#: src/errormessages.ts:79
msgid "Failed to load document."
msgstr "Theip ar an doiciméad a lódáil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:81
msgid "Save failed due to no disk space left. Document will now be read-only."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar an sábháil mar gheall nach raibh spás diosca fágtha. Beidh an "
"doiciméad inléite amháin anois."

#: src/errormessages.ts:84
msgid ""
"The document is too large or no disk space left to save. Document will now "
"be read-only."
msgstr ""
"Tá an doiciméad ró-mhór nó níl aon spás diosca fágtha le spáráil. Beidh an "
"doiciméad inléite amháin anois."

#: src/errormessages.ts:87
msgid ""
"Document cannot be saved due to expired session, please reopen the document "
"to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an doiciméad a shábháil mar gheall ar sheisiún atá imithe in éag, "
"le do thoil oscail an doiciméad arís chun leanúint ar aghaidh."

#: src/errormessages.ts:89
msgid "Document cannot be saved."
msgstr "Ní féidir an doiciméad a shábháil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:90 src/errormessages.ts:109
msgid "The storage refused to save the document."
msgstr "Dhiúltaigh an stóras an doiciméad a shábháil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:91
msgid "Document cannot be renamed."
msgstr "Ní féidir an doiciméad a athainmniú."

#: src/errormessages.ts:95
msgid ""
"Failed to read document from storage, please try to load the document again."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar an doiciméad a léamh ón stóras, déan iarracht an doiciméad a lódáil "
"arís."

#: src/errormessages.ts:98
msgid ""
"Save failed due to no storage space left. The document will now be read-"
"only. Please make sure enough disk space is available and try to save again."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar shábháil mar gheall ar aon spás stórála fágtha. Beidh an doiciméad "
"inléite amháin anois. Cinntigh go bhfuil go leor spáis diosca ar fáil agus "
"déan iarracht é a shábháil arís."

#: src/errormessages.ts:101
msgid ""
"Save failed because the document is too large or exceeds the remaining "
"storage space. The document will now be read-only but you may still "
"download it now to preserve a copy locally."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar shábháil toisc go bhfuil an doiciméad ró-mhór nó go sáraíonn sé an "
"spás stórála atá fágtha. Beidh an doiciméad inléite amháin anois ach is "
"féidir leat é a íoslódáil anois chun cóip a chaomhnú go háitiúil."

#: src/errormessages.ts:104
msgid ""
"Document cannot be saved due to expired session, please reload the page to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an doiciméad a shábháil mar gheall ar an seisiún a chuaigh in éag, "
"le do thoil athlódáil an leathanach chun leanúint ar aghaidh."

#: src/errormessages.ts:107
msgid "Document cannot be saved, please check your permissions."
msgstr "Ní féidir an doiciméad a shábháil, seiceáil do cheadanna."

#: src/errormessages.ts:111
msgid "Document cannot be renamed, please check your permissions."
msgstr "Ní féidir an doiciméad a athainmniú, seiceáil do cheadanna."

#: src/errormessages.ts:113
msgid "Document cannot be exported. Please try again."
msgstr "Ní féidir an doiciméad a easpórtáil. Bain triail eile as."

